# Licensing

`window-server` is free software, licensed under the **GNU General Public License,
version 3 or later**.

`COPYING` carries the verbatim text of the licence, as published by the Free Software
Foundation at <https://www.gnu.org/licenses/>. Do not edit it.

Every source file carries:

```
SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
```

## Why version 3 and not 2

Agora's stack links `libagora-core` and `libagora-dispatch`, which are Apache-2.0
extractions of Apple's swift-corelibs. Apache-2.0 is incompatible with GPL-2.0 and
compatible with GPL-3.0 only, so version 3 is the only licence this program can be
distributed under.

## History

Before 2026-10-22 this repository was MIT licensed. Every commit up to and including
`9d48a29` remains available under those terms; no release was ever tagged. The change and
its rationale are recorded in `LICENSE-CHANGE.md` in the Agora superproject.
